# User property add & edit — frozen (do not modify)

The user completed testing on **user portal Add Property** (`/user/add-property`) and **Edit Property** (`/user/edit-property`). Treat these flows as **production-stable**. Do not change them while working on **agent** project/property testing unless the user **explicitly** requests changes to user property add/edit.

## Frozen scope (frontend)

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `src/components/agent/property/AddProperty.jsx` | User + agent add property (user route via `isUserRoute` / `/user/`) |
