## Verified user-property behavior (preserve)

- Map pin / GPS → geocode → area & sub-area suggest or link when name matches master
- **By Google** and **By Customer** address fields saved on submit (`manual_address`, `client_address`, `customer_address`)
- `buildAreaListingSaveFields(..., { isUserPortal: true })` on save — suggest-only for new area/sub; link existing names
- `area_listing_user_portal` + `area_listing_user_suggested` sent to API
- After admin approves listing: area/sub materialized in master DB; suggestions cleared
- Redirect to `/user/listings?tab=properties` after successful save

